## 1. Prerequisites

Install whatever is missing, using the platform's standard package manager:
winget on Windows, Homebrew on macOS, or the distribution's manager on Linux.

| Tool | Requirement |
|---|---|
| Git, GitHub CLI (`gh`) | any current version |
| Node.js | ≥ 22 via `fnm` (an LTS release is fine), with fnm's shell initialiser added to the user's shell profile |
