| Claude Code | official native installer for the OS |
| Codex CLI | `npm install -g @openai/codex` (`npm.cmd` on Windows if script policy blocks `npm.ps1`) |

The user logs in: `gh auth login`, Claude Code `/login` and `codex login`.

**Check:** every tool prints its version; `uv python find 3.13` returns a path;
