## 9. Keeping indexes fresh

Nothing here refreshes code-review-graph in the background. After pulls,
branch switches or large edits, the agent should call
`build_or_update_graph_tool` and `index_repository` before relying on the
results. (The AGENTS.md text in section 7 tells it to.) Do **not** install
background Git refresh hooks. They skip worktrees and hide failures.

