## Undo

- Remove the three server entries from each client: `claude mcp remove <name> -s user`,
  and delete the tables from Codex's `config.toml`.
- Restore the backed-up configs.
- Run `node scripts/setup.mjs uninstall --yes` in the aih-extensions checkout.
- Run `uv tool uninstall code-review-graph serena-agent`.
- Delete the codebase-memory-mcp binary and the per-repo `.code-review-graph/`
  and `.serena/` folders only if the user asks.
